OL,3,GNEWSAHome affairs president bemoans
OL,4,A'data vacuum'
OL,5,
OL,6,FPressure is growing on the States to
OL,7,Fpublish up to date information on the
OL,8,Fisland's population, after a lack of
OL,9,Frecent figures has been criticised by
OL,10,Fanother senior politician.
OL,12,FHome affairs president Marc Leadbeater
OL,13,Fsaid "we have a data vacuum across the
OL,14,FStates" and it was important to get up
OL,15,Fto date figures for a review of the
OL,16,Fisland's population regime.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
