OL,3,GNEWSAHome affairs president bemoans
OL,4,A'data vacuum'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn June policy and resources president
OL,7,FLindsay de Sausmarez told the States,
OL,8,Fexternal: "The committee will soon be
OL,9,Fable to confirm a timetable for the
OL,10,Fpublication of fully up-to-date
OL,11,Fnational statistics."
OL,13,FSo far that timetable has not been
OL,14,Fproduced. The States has blamed issues
OL,15,Fwith the revenue service for the lack
OL,16,Fof up to date statistics.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
